      <li>Do not choose “paramedical” only for a quick hospital job. Many routes start with modest pay and limited scale; prioritise specialisations with scarce equipment skill, licensing, home-service potential, diagnostics ownership, health-tech, or a clear management ladder.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

